# Day planner is a ticket

The planning device is a **ticket**. User-facing copy must use `DAY_PLAN_NAME` / `DAY_PLAN_TODAY` / `DAY_PLAN_SAVED_HREF` from `@/lib/constants`. Never call it a slip or a planner.

```tsx
// BAD
<p>Today’s slip</p>
<span>Add to planner</span>

// GOOD
import { DAY_PLAN_NAME, DAY_PLAN_TODAY } from "@/lib/constants";
<p>{DAY_PLAN_TODAY}</p>
<span>Add to {DAY_PLAN_NAME}</span>
```

The sign-in overlay (`GuestSignInSlip`) is a different surface. `bg-ticket` / `--ticket` is the yellow plate color, not this name.
